  "solution": {
    "text": "Limestone $\\left(\\mathrm{CaCO}_{3}\\right)$ is mixed with $\\mathrm{Fe}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{3}$ and it acts as flux to form slag $\\left(\\mathrm{CaSiO}_{3}\\right)$.",
